TITLE:: PV_HPecartType
summary:: Spectral transformation based on standard deviation
categories:: UGens>FFT
related:: Classes/FFT, Classes/IFFT, Classes/PV_ChainUGen

DESCRIPTION::
Processes an FFT chain using the standard-deviation algorithm defined by the HPPV_UGens plugin. This UGen must be placed between FFT and IFFT.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new

ARGUMENT:: chain
A PV chain produced by FFT or another PV UGen.

ARGUMENT:: multiplier
The multiplier used by the spectral processing algorithm.

RETURNS::
A PV chain.

EXAMPLES::

code::
(
{
    var source = WhiteNoise.ar(0.05);
    var chain = FFT(LocalBuf(2048), source);
    chain = PV_HPecartType(chain, 1);
    IFFT(chain) ! 2
}.play;
)
::
